    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't Lose Hope begins with a man who was fired from his job and whose life was ruined, starting his dream job as a baker with his wife.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shopping System</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients such as flour, salt, yeast from the computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knead dough using ingredients, produce bread and sell at the market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your ingredient stock by earning income from each sale.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development System</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small market stall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the chance to buy bigger stalls, more products and your own oven by managing your income correctly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance on the path to becoming the biggest baker in the city!</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't Lose Hope begins with a man who was fired from his job and whose life was ruined, starting his dream job as a baker with his wife.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shopping System</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients such as flour, salt, yeast from the computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knead dough using ingredients, produce bread and sell at the market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your ingredient stock by earning income from each sale.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development System</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small market stall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the chance to buy bigger stalls, more products and your own oven by managing your income correctly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance on the path to becoming the biggest baker in the city!</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
